codex
I’m testing a moment-matching correction on the hidden layers processed during `predict`: after each ReLU, it nudges each neuron’s sampled mean/variance toward the normal-moment estimate from that layer’s sampled preactivations. This is a control-variate style correction and can be dialed down if it adds bias.
apply patch
